 * Run:  node tools/test-greek-quiz.mjs
 *
 * The scoring core lives in server/scoring.mjs (moved out of the browser bundle);
 * it is imported directly. The full quiz file is server-private under
 * server/content/. DOM-dependent behaviour is covered by asserting the wiring
 * exists in source, because the fallback is a browser event handler.
 */
